# This folder is a shared Obsidian vault / corpus-texts folder, not a
# dedicated repo - it holds source books, a PDF, and (deliberately)
# an Anarchist Cookbook folder that must never be pushed anywhere.
# So: ignore everything by default, and only track the bot's own
# code/config. New files dropped into this folder (more corpus texts,
# vault notes, etc.) are excluded automatically unless added below.
*

!.gitignore
!README.md
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!.env.example

!scripts
!scripts/*

!src
!src/*

!.github
!.github/*
!.github/workflows
!.github/workflows/*

!data
!data/*
